{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n《女神配對計劃2》陳若思近日人氣急升，最新一集更大方卸妝，以睡衣造型展現自然一面。然而，這位如今備受矚目的女神，原來11年前曾是網片中的無名小角色！從沒有對白的茄喱啡，到鏡頭前大跳熱舞的偽女團成員，她的青澀演出逐一被翻出，背後更牽涉一段曾經鬧得沸沸揚揚的富豪緋聞。\n</p>\n<h2>節目水族館露營陳星妤陳若思素顏上陣</h2>\n<p>製作組在巨型海洋景觀玻璃牆前搭建多個溫暖浪漫露營帳篷，安排女神與求愛勇者進行夜宿體驗。陳星妤換上深色長袖居家服展現精緻立體五官，而陳若思則穿上超可愛黑白卡通狗圖案睡衣亮相。戴上黑框眼鏡並愜意躺臥在帳篷內陳若思，對著鏡頭燦爛微笑兼比出V字手勢，展現鄰家女孩氣質。</p>\n<h2>揭秘陳若思十九歲演出網片心酸血淚</h2>\n<p>原來早在11年前陳若思就已經涉足娛樂圈，19歲時曾連續兩屆擔任官方活動模特兒。當年她以本名陳紫瑩拍攝YouTube網片，參演過不少零對白小角色，包括在劇集《PA血淚史》中飾演偽女團成員跳二創歌曲《Sugar Daddy》，又曾於拳擊網片擔任舉牌小姐大騷纖腰。直到2015年她憑藉出眾顏值加入鍾培生旗下電競公司擔任電競模特兒。</p>\n<h2>陳若思堅決否認曾遭鍾培生包養傳聞</h2>\n<p>陳若思過往與電競公司老闆鍾培生緋聞再度成為討論焦點。早在2022年外界曾瘋傳兩人曾有一段情甚至涉及包養傳聞，面對外界諸多揣測，陳若思當時已經親自出面嚴正否認。她公開澄清「從未拍拖」，並強調雙方只有前上司與下屬關係，自己一直只當對方是哥哥看待。</p>\n<h2>《女神配對計劃2》熱播引發網民熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>網民對於兩位女神在節目中素顏狀態及陳若思過去背景議論紛紛。有網民在討論區留言表示「估唔到Amber以前做過咁多茄喱啡角色真係捱出嚟」，亦有人將焦點放在水族館環節上，直指「陳星妤素顏依然好靚女完全冇走樣」。針對陳若思與鍾培生緋聞，部分網民留言稱「娛樂圈啲緋聞真係信不信由你」，討論熱度持續攀升。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935112813061_10437071066af965879b336.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935112813061_10437071066af965879b336.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935288779085_9435955736af9658938cde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935288779085_9435955736af9658938cde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935403561889_17349708146af9658a6c8b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935403561889_17349708146af9658a6c8b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935591089810_21220424586af9658c52a70.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935591089810_21220424586af9658c52a70.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935778261471_17574336076af9658e1de38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935778261471_17574336076af9658e1de38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935930662931_13691797766af9658fca042.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935930662931_13691797766af9658fca042.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936148533170_18672680696af965926ea37.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936148533170_18672680696af965926ea37.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936399894331_15644153806af96594f2f89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936399894331_15644153806af96594f2f89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936622064966_8248575086af96596a7ef4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936622064966_8248575086af96596a7ef4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936789836277_5019370416af96598d4a34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936789836277_5019370416af96598d4a34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:17:34.259779+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1151,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:56:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T08:52:00.920225+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:11:31.132164+00:00","content_hash":"e547405e41ea33eb7cd899d517bd4325964f1b1c673401d8e7a397d24bfa296a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}